  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_PRINCIPLES_OF_INHERITANCE_AND_VARIATION_DIAGRAM_MCQ_Q02 - Haplodiploid sex determination pathway in honey bee</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The diagram below outlines the haplodiploid system of sex determination in honey bee:</p>
<div style="text-align:center; margin:10px 0;">
<svg width="440" height="240" viewBox="0 0 440 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="background:#ffffff; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;">
