    <name>
      <text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_PRINCIPLES_OF_INHERITANCE_AND_VARIATION_DIAGRAM_MCQ_Q03 - Microscopic and molecular changes in sickle cell</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The diagram below depicts the molecular genetics of normal haemoglobin (\(Hb^A\)) and sickle-cell haemoglobin (\(Hb^S\)) at the sixth position of the \(\beta\)-globin chain:</p>
